      <data key="d1">"Alice is a new clerk hired by HaileyJohnson to assist with doorstep delivery service for milk and bread."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person delivering a bread delivery message to the recipient."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person delivering a message about bread delivery from Hailey's bakery."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person delivering bread to a customer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person identified as a delivery recipient at Hailey's bakery."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person who identifies herself and mentions her affiliation with Hailey's bakery."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person who identifies herself as a baker from Hailey's bakery and informs someone to pick up her delivered bread."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is the sender of a message from Hailey's Bakery."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person representing Hailey's bakery, providing a delivery update and wishing the recipient a good day."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person who represents Hailey's bakery, providing a delivery update and wishing the recipient a good day."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person delivering a message."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person working at Hailey's bakery, providing a delivery notification to the recipient."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person delivering a message from Hailey's bakery."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person delivering a message to someone about the delivery of bread from Hailey's bakery."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person who works at Hailey's bakery, delivering bread."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person giving a delivery update."|&gt;|&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person representing Hailey's bakery, providing a delivery update."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person delivering a message to someone about the delivery of bread from Hailey's bakery."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person who identifies herself and provides a message related to a bakery."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person mentioned who will bring the gluten-free bread to LiHua."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person delivering fresh bread to LiHua in the morning."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alice is a person me