    <node id="&quot;LIHUA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Li Hua confirms everyone's enthusiasm for the garage sale and looks forward to seeing what everyone brings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Li Hua is a participant who plans to bring items to sell and looks forward to catching up with everyone."&lt;SEP&gt;"Li Hua is a person who checks in with Jennifer Moore about her progress and wants to keep track of her fitness plan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Li Hua is a person who responds to Jennifer Moore's check-in and discusses exercise plans."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a participant in a musical jam session planning conversation."|&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person agreeing to help YurikoYamamoto test the new feature for scheduling available time on the studio homepage."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person checking in about the details for moving into a new place with Adam Smith."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who has just arrived in the city and plans to meet WolfgangSchulz for lunch on the 8th."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person seeking information about Wi-Fi password and house rules from AdamSmith."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who reports a broken water tab to AdamSmith."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who confirms the water tap appointment with AdamSmith and prepares for the plumber's arrival."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who expresses enthusiasm about the city and plans to explore with Wolfgang."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who responds positively to WolfgangSchulz's reminder and shares her food preferences."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who informs AdamSmith about accidentally breaking a light fixture in her apartment."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who informs AdamSmith about breaking a light fixture in her apartment."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person moving into a new place and seeking photography tips from WolfgangSchulz."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person seeking photography tips from WolfgangSchulz for capturing epic photos in the city."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who expresses gratitude and appreciation for the door hinge repair arranged by AdamSmith."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who finds a cool spot and invites WolfgangSchulz to join her for a photography walk."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is inviting WolfgangSchulz to join her for a photography walk, expressing enthusiasm and excitement about exploring a new spot."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who asks AdamSmith about the process for reporting maintenance issues in the house."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a user seeking recommendations for fitness centers."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a tenant who expresses gratitude to her landlord, Adam Smith, for addressing a light fixture issue."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who will provide a demo website for YurikoYamamoto's studio and looks forward to sharing it with her."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a student who reaches out to Jennifer to request a class schedule change."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who agrees to help YurikoYamamoto test the new feature for scheduling available time on the studio homepage."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who tests new features on a studio's homepage and provides feedback and suggestions."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who responds positively to AdamSmith's invitation to the community bake sale."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who responded to YurikoYamamoto's suggestions and helped brainstorm ideas for a community outreach section."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person interested in trying HaileyJohnson's doorstep delivery service."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is the person who receives the sourdough loaf and milk, expresses appreciation for HaileyJohnson's bread, and inquires about the bakery's process."|&gt;"customer, appreciative"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person initiating a meeting with Yuriko and providing details about the final website presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who is inviting Yuriko to view the final website and discussing a meeting time."|&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who is inviting Yuriko to view the final website and discussing a meeting time."|&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who initiates a request to invite a new friend, Yuriko, to a Sunday jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who makes a new friend named Yuriko and invites her to a Sunday jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who expresses gratitude and makes requests for bread delivery from HaileyJohnson."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person inviting Yuriko to join music jam sessions with Wolfgang."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who introduces Yuriko and Wolfgang, plans a jam session, and expresses excitement about upcoming events."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who initiates and coordinates a jam session, sharing song suggestions and organizing responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a participant in the bonfire singing party and plans to bring her guitar."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is accepting ChaeSong-hwa's invitation to join the bonfire singing party and bringing her guitar."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a participant in musical jams and suggests playing a Beatles song."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua provides recommendations and advice on drum brands and models."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who receives the reminder about the delivery of fresh bread and expresses enthusiasm for the rosemary focaccia."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who acknowledges AdamSmith's reminder and commits to following the recycling rules."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who checks out the tutorial and expresses excitement for the jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who provides feedback and support."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who receives the reminder about the delivery of fresh bread and expresses gratitude."|&gt;"bread delivery, gratitude"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who responds to AdamSmith's reminder about rent."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who communicates about rent transfer and apartment conditions with Adam Smith."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who transfers rent and checks on apartment conditions with Adam Smith."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who expressed surprise at WolfgangSchulz's drum purchase and looks forward to future jam sessions with WolfgangSchulz and YurikoYamamoto."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who expresses interest in HaileyJohnson's new gluten-free bread options and eagerly awaits trying them."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a participant in a jam session, offering suggestions and participating in discussions."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who receives the fresh bread delivery from Alice and expresses excitement about trying it."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is organizing a jam session and suggesting the song "Viva la Vida"."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is the organizer of the jam session and suggests the song "Viva la Vida"."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua expresses interest in attending ChaeSong-hwa's medical knowledge lecture and looks forward to learning more about health topics."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who explores the city, tries to keep her spirits up, and plans a jam session with WolfgangSchulz."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a drummer who expresses interest in trying the app and participating in a jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who receives a reminder about a community medical knowledge lecture and participates in the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who responds positively to HaileyJohnson's announcement and expresses interest in attending the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a user asking questions about neurosurgery tools for a website she is designing."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person mentioned in the conversation, discussing work and personal life with ChaeSong-hwa."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who responds to reminders and discusses their workload and focus."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who agrees to the break and looks forward to the next jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who provides ideas for community garden renovation, such as adding seating areas and flower beds with native plants."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who shared pictures of Hailey's bakery and expressed her enjoyment of the treats."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person participating in a karaoke activity and conversing with ChaeSong-hwa."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who participates in a karaoke activity and converses with ChaeSong-hwa."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person discussing personal matters, including her gym membership, with Jennifer Moore."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is the organizer of the jam session and introduces his friend Chae."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a participant in virtual conversations, planning activities and expressing excitement for future events."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua organizes and facilitates virtual gatherings, encouraging conversation and planning activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua represents an online community or platform facilitating virtual interactions among participants."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua expresses interest in joining AdamSmith's group chat for garden renovation activities and looks forward to sharing ideas and collaborating."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua conveys enthusiasm for the garden's development, describing it as an amazing place where everyone can enjoy nature and collaborate."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua expresses enthusiasm for the bench and flower bed ideas, emphasizing the creation of a pleasant atmosphere and a relaxing space for people to enjoy outdoors."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person involved in the renovation project, sharing ideas and expressing excitement about the garden's potential."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a team member who suggests organizing Sunday nights like a band and encourages participation."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who acknowledges HaileyJohnson's reminder and expresses anticipation of the promotion."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua emphasizes the impact of hydration on recovery and suggests drinking enough water to maintain energy levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua mentions adding a warm-up routine focused on breathing and relaxation to their routine."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua mentions the impact of hydration on recovery and suggests drinking enough water to maintain energy levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua offers tips on maintaining balance and rhythm during squats."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who congratulates WolfgangSchulz on his promotion and agrees to join him for dinner."|&gt;"celebration, dinner"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who communicates with AdamSmith about transferring rent."|&gt;"communication, financial matters"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who responds positively to WolfgangSchulz's promotion and eagerly anticipates the dinner."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua offers a suggestion to schedule the repair work during off-peak hours to reduce inconvenience."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is enthusiastic about trying a towel grip and wants to share her progress with the team."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua supports the creative process, proposing ideas like 'The Melody Makers' and 'Groove Alliance' and appreciating the team's energy."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person providing advice and assistance to YurikoYamamoto regarding the 'leave a message' feature."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who provides advice and assistance to YurikoYamamoto regarding the 'leave a message' feature."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a character who agrees with community involvement and looks forward to the first meeting."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person seeking new trails in the area and proposing a group run."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a teammate providing advice on including a mix of long runs and speed sessions, along with strength training, hydration, and recovery for Brimstone."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who encourages the team to stay focused and supportive, aiming for progress."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who looks forward to hearing updates and maintaining positive energy."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua emphasizes the importance of a plan for garden maintenance to ensure its success in the long term."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who expresses interest in attending a web design seminar at WolfgangSchulz's company."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who expresses interest in joining WolfgangSchulz for a web design seminar at his company."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person who declines attending a web tech forum and expresses excitement about a jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is a person r