    <node id="&quot;WOLFGANGSCHULZ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Wolfgang Schulz is a participant in a meeting at the basement and provides suggestions for the music festival."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wolfgang Schulz is a person who discusses plans with Li Hua and suggests playing "Hey Jude" at the jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wolfgang Schulz is a person who introduces himself to Yuriko, expresses excitement about hanging out, and looks forward to a jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wolfgang Schulz is a person who suggests playing "Hey Jude" and offers to help arrange the next jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wolfgang Schulz is a person who reminds the group to save full rehearsals for Sunday and looks forward to the jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wolfgang Schulz participates in musical sessions, discussing the unwinding effect of playing and the therapeutic aspect of music."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz accepts LiHua's invitation to celebrate Chinese Lunar New Year, expressing excitement and willingness to help with preparations."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz agrees to join LiHua for a photography walk, showing interest and eagerness to explore a new location."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz is a person offering photography tips to LiHua about scenic spots in the city."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz is a person welcoming LiHua to the city and providing photography tips."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz is a person who has agreed to meet LiHua for lunch on the 8th and expresses excitement about the meeting."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz is a person who offers suggestions and plans events with LiHua."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz is a person who reminds LiHua about their lunch plan and expresses a preference for warm and hearty food."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz is a person who expresses interest in joining LiHua for a photography walk."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz is a recommender providing information about a gym called FitZone."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz is a person who supports LiHua's invitation to Yuriko to join the Sunday jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz participat