erson who reminds Li Hua about voting for the annual event and offers support."|&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person who reminds Li Hua about the bread promotion and offers assistance."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person who offers promotions and reminders, specifically mentioning Mother's Day."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person promoting a summer promotion for ice cream and pastries."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person who initiates a free baking class invitation to Li Hua."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person who invites Li Hua to a free baking class at the bakery."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person running a bakery and coordinating events."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person who communicates about the launch of a new high-protein bread line."|&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is organizing a free baking class and engaging in conversation with LiHua about dietary restrictions and pastry learning."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is the organizer of a free baking class and communicates with LiHua about dietary restrictions and pastry learning."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person inviting Li Hua to a special event at a bakery."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is part of an organization that is launching a new line of healthy bread options at a bakery."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person who checks in with Li Hua about the bread delivery experience and seeks feedback."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person who checks in with Li Hua about the bread delivery experience and seeks feedback."|&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person involved in creating and testing artisanal donuts."|&gt;person&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person who interacts with Li Hua about pastries, offering suggestions and seeking feedback."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person organizing a bread-tasting event at a bakery and seeking assistance from Li Hua."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person who announces a special sale at the bakery and offers a discount to a regular customer."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson