al gathering planned for Sunday, involving both ChaeSong-hwa and Li Hua."&lt;SEP&gt;"An event where YurikoYamamoto and LiHua plan to play music together."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jam Session is an event where YurikoYamamoto and LiHua plan to play music together."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jam Session is the musical event Li Hua plans to attend on Sunday night."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jam sessions are mentioned as a way to push WolfgangSchulz to be better and more creative."&lt;SEP&gt;"A jam session is planned between YurikoYamamoto and LiHua, likely involving music and possibly incorporating a fun groove."&lt;SEP&gt;"A jam session is planned between YurikoYamamoto and LiHua, likely involving music and possibly incorporating a fun groove."|&gt;|"collaborative effort, jam session planning"&lt;SEP&gt;"Jam Session is an upcoming event where LiHua and WolfgangSchulz plan to play music together, reflecting their positive energy and collaboration."&lt;SEP&gt;"A jam session is a casual musical performance involving two or more musicians improvising or playing pre-composed pieces."&lt;SEP&gt;"A jam session is a musical performance where musicians play music spontaneously and creatively without a formal arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"jam session is a musical gathering where WolfgangSchulz and LiHua plan to participate."</data>
