      <data key="d1">"Malfurion Stormrage expresses excitement about the garage sale and the potential to make it an unforgettable event."&lt;SEP&gt;"MalfurionStormrage agrees with Turalyon's suggestion of limiting noisy activities and proposes notifying residents in advance."&lt;SEP&gt;"MalfurionStormrage is a character expressing anticipation for the garden's completion and the potential for relaxing and gathering with others."&lt;SEP&gt;"MalfurionStormrage is a character who suggests adding benches or seating areas and considers planting times."&lt;SEP&gt;"MalfurionStormrage is a participant in the gardening discussion, expressing enthusiasm and looking forward to the garden transformation."&lt;SEP&gt;"MalfurionStormrage is a person who is excited about working together and turning the community dream into reality."&lt;SEP&gt;"MalfurionStormrage is a person involved in the renovation project, agreeing with the idea of creating a magical garden that reflects community spirit."&lt;SEP&gt;"MalfurionStormrage suggests adding picnic tables for community gatherings and events, focusing on creating a space that encourages social interaction and communal activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"MalfurionStormrage suggests including basil, rosemary, and mint in the garden, emphasizing the culinary and educational value of herbs, and the possibility of encouraging cooking and gardening activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"MalfurionStormrage is a character who supports and encourages the idea of regular community gardening days, emphasizing building camaraderie and looking forward to everyone's contributions."&lt;SEP&gt;"MalfurionStormrage provides positive feedback on the garden's progress and expresses excitement about the community's involvement."&lt;SEP&gt;"MalfurionStormrage suggests creating a routine for community involvement to build camaraderie and ensure the garden's long-term success."&lt;SEP&gt;"MalfurionStormrage is excited to bring the garden vision to life and enjoy it together with every