ng the importance of garden renovation and supporting local businesses."&lt;SEP&gt;"MalfurionStormrage is a participant in the garden improvement discussion, initially thinking about the potential for a first contact, then suggesting a small table or two and shade options."&lt;SEP&gt;"Malfurion Stormrage proposes covering basic first aid, emergency response protocols, and communication strategies in training sessions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Malfurion Stormrage suggests roles like team leader, medic, communication officer, and someone to manage logistics for the community emergency response team."</data>
