      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Emily Burnett emphasizes the importance of resilience, adaptability, and practical training for the peacekeepers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a character who discusses TV shows and recommends others to her friend Li Hua."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a participant in a poll for their favorite HBO series, leading the conversation and asking for opinions on the shows."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a participant in a poll for their favorite HBO series, showing engagement with the discussion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a participant discussing Kendall's motivation in the TV series Succession."|&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a participant in a group chat discussing the series, appreciating the suspense and character complexities, finding the series thrilling and engaging."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a participant in a group chat discussing the series, appreciating the suspense and character complexities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is the host of the discussion about the most hateable character in Game of Thrones, encouraging votes and setting up the voting process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a person mentioned in the conversation, expressing interest in meeting a character similar to Sheldon from 'Big Bang Theory'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a participant in a discussion about characters from Game of Thrones, expressing admiration for Tyrion Lannister and Arya Stark."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a participant in a discussion about the character 'Man in Black' in Westworld."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a participant in the conversation, providing insights into the character 'Man in Black' and discussing themes in Westworld."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a person discussing The Rings of Power series with LiHua."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a character speculating on how history might write Cersei's story, mentioning both villainy and tragedy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a person who discusses the character development of Cersei Lannister in Game of Thrones."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a character discussing her favorite shows, particularly 'Chernobyl' and 'Game of Thrones'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a fan discussing the portrayal of morally gray characters in TV series."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a person discussing Jaime Lannister's journey and transformation in the show."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a participant in discussions about groups and communities, sharing her experience with TV series fans and recommending art-related spaces."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a character contributing thoughts on the drama, character evolution, and philosophical debates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a character who engages in a conversation about favorite comedy TV series with Li Hua."&lt;SEP&gt;"Emily Burnett is a participant in the discussion, sharing her views on the challenges faced by start-ups and the lessons learned from the show."&lt;SEP&gt;"EmilyBurnett emphasizes the importance of resilience, adaptability, and practical training for the peacekeepers."&lt;SEP&gt;"EmilyBurnett is a participant in the discussion about potential future developments in Westworld and the ethical considerations surrounding AI and consciousness."&lt;SEP&gt;"EmilyBurnett is a user who recommends sci-fi shows to LiHua and discusses her own viewing habits."</data>
