benefits in combat and adding to the adrenaline rush."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caelum proposes urban warfare scenarios in places like Tokyo or Machu Picchu, incorporating historical sites and modern warfare tactics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caelum is a character who discusses the impact of NPCs in games like Oxenfree."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caelum is a player who speaks about the bond with the horse in "Red Dead Redemption 2", describing it as a realistic and impactful aspect of the game's narrative."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caelum is a participant in the discussion, describing "Final Fantasy VII Remake" and "Horizon Forbidden West" for their lighting and environmental details."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caelum is a participant in the discussion, discussing "Ghost of Tsushima" and "Final Fantasy VII Remake" with their visuals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caelum is a participant in the discussion, emphasizing the exploration and weather effects in "Assassin's Creed Valhalla" for an immersive experience."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caelum is a participant in a discussion about open-world games, describing an intense and adrenaline-fueled battle in Red Dead Redemption 2 against a monster den."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caelum is a player discussing the game Dishonored and sharing his favorite abilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caelum is a player who focused on stealth and crit damage in Assassin's Creed Odyssey, adding a new dimension to the gameplay."</data>
