    <node id="&quot;ARTHUR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Arthur is a character in the Van der Linde gang storyline, grappling with morality and making significant choices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Arthur is a character mentioned in relation to Dutch, often portrayed as a mentor or father figure who provides guidance and support."&lt;SEP&gt;"Arthur is mentioned as part of Dutch's gang, experiencing the shift from a father-son bond to manipulation and the erosion of trust."&lt;SEP&gt;"Arthur is a character who experiences freezing during cutscenes and tripping during dialogues, adding to the game's unpredictable and entertaining aspects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Arthur is a character who experiences various glitches, including floating in mid-air and flailing limbs, highlighting the unpredictable and entertaining nature of the game."&lt;SEP&gt;"Arthur is a character who gets stuck in various positions during cutscenes and dialogue scenes, leading to comedic reactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Arthur is a character who interacts with NPCs, such as floating in mid-air and having limbs flail, creating memorable and humorous moments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Arthur is a protagonist of the game, experiencing personal growth and forming relationships with other characters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Arthur is the main character, often performing actions like jumping off cliffs and experiencing glitches, showing his resilience and unpredictable nature."&lt;SEP&gt;"Arthur is another character in the game, often contrasted with Micah Bell, whose character arc is shaped by their dynamic."</data>
