    <edge source="&quot;LIHUA&quot;" target="&quot;WOLFGANGSCHULZ&quot;">
      <data key="d3">1083.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Both LiHua and WolfgangSchulz express enthusiasm for AI and discuss its potential applications and impacts on various fields."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and WolfgangSchulz are both participants in the jam session planning and execution, contributing ideas and enthusiasm."|&gt;"idea sharing, enthusiasm"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and WolfgangSchulz are planning to meet at the gym for a workout session, with LiHua expressing enthusiasm and WolfgangSchulz agreeing to the plan."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and WolfgangSchulz both participate in the musical jams and offer suggestions."|&gt;"participant, suggestion exchange"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and WolfgangSchulz plan to meet for lunch on the 8th, indicating a social arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and WolfgangSchulz plan to meet for lunch on the 8th, indicating a social arrangement."|&gt;"social arrangement, mutual excitement"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua seeks advice from Wolfgang about upcoming events in the city and plans to explore with him."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz reminds LiHua about their lunch plan and expresses interest in the same place, indicating a friendly relationship and mutual planning."|&gt;"reminder, lunch planning"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua invites WolfgangSchulz to join her for a photography walk, suggesting a friendly and collaborative relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua seeks advice from WolfgangSchulz about fitness centers, and WolfgangSchulz recommends FitZone."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz seeks recommendations from LiHua for drum brands and models, and LiHua provides advice and suggestions."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz expresses enthusiasm for the jam session, while LiHua offers suggestions and participates actively."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz and LiHua discuss their respective feelings about work and leisure time, planning a jam session to recharge."|&gt;"jam session planning"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua organizes WolfgangSchulz to participate in jamming sessions, promoting musical collaboration and enjoyment."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua organizes WolfgangSchulz to participate in jamming sessions, promoting musical collaboration and enjoyment."|&gt;"jamming, musical collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua proposes organizing Sunday nights like a band, and WolfgangSchulz agrees to make it official."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua suggests organizing Sunday nights like a band, and WolfgangSchulz agrees to make it official."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz invites LiHua to celebrate his promotion with dinner at their favorite Italian place."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz encourages the team to keep sharing ideas, fostering a collaborative environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz invites LiHua to attend the web design seminar at his company."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz invites LiHua to join him for the web design seminar at his company."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua invites WolfgangSchulz to celebrate Chinese Lunar New Year, indicating a friendly and social relationship between them."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua invites WolfgangSchulz to her place for dinner and plans activities post-meal."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz wishes LiHua a happy Lunar New Year and discusses plans for celebrations and traditions, indicating a friendly exchange."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and WolfgangSchulz plan to meet for dinner to enjoy a shared dessert, showcasing their friendship and shared culinary interests."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua declines to participate but expresses eagerness to see everyone and make music together, indicating a positive outlook on the jam session despite disagreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz initiates a dinner invitation at their favorite Italian place, expressing a desire to catch up before enjoying the meal."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz invites LiHua to a dinner at their favorite Italian place, expressing a desire to catch up before enjoying the meal."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua offers advice and encouragement to WolfgangSchulz, helping him cope with his tiredness and seek solutions to boost his energy."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and WolfgangSchulz discuss the importance of having a jam session, emphasizing the fun and creative aspects of music-making."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz suggests bringing snacks for fuel, and LiHua agrees with the idea of snacks to keep the energy up during the jam."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz encourages LiHua to bring her guitar and enthusiasm, supporting her participation in the Music Jam Sessions."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz invites LiHua to hang out after work, indicating a social invitation and agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz invites LiHua to a Thai restaurant for dinner, establishing a social gathering between them."|&gt;"dinner invitation, social gathering"&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz invites LiHua to a coffee shop meeting, showing a friendly invitation and social engagement."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz and LiHua engage in conversation about music, suggesting a musical collaboration."|&gt;"musical collaboration, discussion"&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz and LiHua engage in a conversation about their shared interest in superheroes and Marvel movies."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz invites LiHua to check out 'Overwatch 3' tomorrow, initiating a social event."|&gt;"social invitation, entertainment plan"&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz invites LiHua to watch "Overwatch 3" tomorrow, initiating a social event."|&gt;"social invitation, entertainment plan"&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz reminds LiHua about the movie night, and they discuss details such as dinner location and meeting time."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz initiates dinner invitations and suggests low-key weekend activities, while LiHua declines and suggests similar activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz invites LiHua for dinner and suggests low-key weekend activities, showing a friendly and flexible approach to plans."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz provides advice to LiHua on managing client requirements and taking breaks."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz suggests incorporating original songs, while LiHua supports the idea and mentions fun and mixing things up."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz agrees to stick to Sundays and LiHua confirms the usual jam day."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua reminds WolfgangSchulz about the photography exhibition and plans a meeting place and time."|"reminder, planning"&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz and LiHua engage in a conversation about the exhibition, discussing their favorite photos and sharing personal impressions."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz initiates the conversation and planning, while LiHua responds positively and suggests supplies."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz and LiHua discuss plans for a trip to a local music store for a jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz and LiHua discuss plans for a trip to a local music store, showing coordination and planning for a joint activity."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua provides emotional support and encouragement to WolfgangSchulz, helping him navigate the pressures of the new software project."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz receives support and encouragement from LiHua, who believes in his talent and offers guidance to help him deal with the pressure from the new software project."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz and LiHua discuss music plans, including possible new songs to try out at their next jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua shares jazz ideas and vibes with WolfgangSchulz, preparing for the jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua invites WolfgangSchulz to have hot pot for dinner, establishing a social plan."|&gt;"invitation, social plan"&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz is reaching out to LiHua to inform her about the progress of the software and seek feedback."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua invites WolfgangSchulz to watch Star Wars: A New Hope, suggesting the possibility of a movie night together."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz initiates a dinner invitation with LiHua."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz invites LiHua to grab some pizza for dinner, and they discuss the details of their meeting time."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and WolfgangSchulz engage in a friendly conversation about pizza preferences and plans."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and WolfgangSchulz have a collaborative jam session, fostering a special chemistry that drives both of them."|&gt;"chemistry, inspiration"&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz and LiHua plan to attend a stand-up comedy show together, discussing timing and venue."|&gt;"social engagement, event planning"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and WolfgangSchulz engage in a friendly conversation about their favorite fast food items and places."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both LiHua and WolfgangSchulz stress the importance of maintaining good sleep and diet routines, highlighting their shared values and health consciousness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both LiHua and WolfgangSchulz stress the importance of maintaining good sleep and diet routines, highlighting their shared values and health consciousness."|&gt;"shared values, health consciousness"&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz and LiHua plan to work out together, supporting each other's fitness goals."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and WolfgangSchulz engage in a conversation about healthy breakfast options and recipes."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz informs LiHua about his trip to Hong Kong and asks her for preferences."|&gt;"communication, itinerary planning"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua provides tips and encouragement to WolfgangSchulz for his photography trip to Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz asks LiHua about song preparation and suggestions, and LiHua provides feedback and ideas."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz shares travel plans and intentions with LiHua, seeking her advice and assistance in exploring Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and WolfgangSchulz discuss plans to ski together next weekend."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua invites WolfgangSchulz to participate in a jam session, suggesting a planned musical event."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua invites WolfgangSchulz to go shopping for a guitar and participate in jamming sessions."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and WolfgangSchulz engage in a humorous exchange, sharing a moment of camaraderie and appreciation for jokes."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua invites Wolfgang to her new basement for a musical jam session, suggesting they play together and catch up."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz cancels the jam session initially but later agrees to reschedule it."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz and LiHua plan to meet up for dinner before attending the concert."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz suggests painting as a new hobby for Li Hua to unwind from work stress."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua introduces Wolfgang and plans a jam session, showing their mutual interest in music and social gatherings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wolfgang Schulz talks about the unwinding effect of playing music, while Li Hua expresses the refreshing experience of making music and the motivation to create new tunes."|&gt;"experience sharing, motivation"</data>
