    <edge source="&quot;LIHUA&quot;" target="&quot;ADAMSMITH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">891.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"AdamSmith and Li Hua discuss various topics including the new fridge, their weeks, and gaming activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith and LiHua discuss Lunar New Year traditions and plans, showing a friendly exchange of ideas and interests."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith informs LiHua about the water tap appointment and provides support if needed."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua seeks information from AdamSmith about Wi-Fi password and house rules."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua informs AdamSmith about the incident, prompting AdamSmith to take action."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua informs AdamSmith about the incident, prompting AdamSmith to take action."|&gt;communication, assistance request&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua expresses gratitude and appreciation for AdamSmith's door hinge repair arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua seeks information from AdamSmith about reporting maintenance issues via WhatsApp."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua reaches out to AdamSmith for further assistance and updates on his life, showing a supportive and connected relationship."|&gt;"supportive relationship, social interaction"&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith invites LiHua to join the community bake sale, which LiHua accepts and looks forward to attending."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith reminds LiHua about rent due soon."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith provides updates and assistance to LiHua regarding the apartment."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua informs AdamSmith about the rent transfer and asks for his opinion on apartment matters."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith initiates the conversation about community garden renovation and gathers ideas from LiHua."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith invites LiHua to join the group chat for garden renovation activities, indicating a collaborative effort."|&gt;"invitation, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua informs AdamSmith about the rent transfer and seeks further assistance, while AdamSmith acknowledges and offers help."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua informs AdamSmith about the rent transfer and seeks further assistance, while AdamSmith acknowledges and offers help."|&gt;"communication, seeking assistance"&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith reminds Li Hua about the rent payment due, and Li Hua agrees to take care of it."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both AdamSmith and LiHua express engagement and excitement about the garden project, showing a positive relationship between them."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith announces noise reduction measures, which LiHua agrees and encourages positive feedback."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith informs LiHua about necessary repairs and provides updates on the schedule and timeline, while also checking in on LiHua's comfort during the process."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua reaches out to AdamSmith for reassurance and information."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua seeks information from AdamSmith about adding an air-conditioner to the basement."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith provides advice and recommendations to Li Hua regarding air-conditioner installation in the basement."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith informs LiHua about maintenance work in the building and asks for preferred avoidance times."|"maintenance communication, scheduling"&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith reminds LiHua about the rent being due and offers payment options if needed."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith seeks advice from LiHua on purchasing an energy-efficient and quiet air conditioner for the basement."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith communicates updates and reminders to LiHua, who responds and expresses hopes and appreciations."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith initiates a conversation about the warranty and maintenance plans for an air conditioner with Li Hua."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith reminds Li Hua about the contractor team's visit to the basement at 6 PM."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith reminds Li Hua about the contractor team's visit to the basement at 6 PM."|&gt;"reminder, meeting confirmation"&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith checks on Li Hua's air-conditioner in the basement, ensuring it is functioning properly."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith checks in on Li Hua regarding the basement's condition after a storm."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith initiates a check-in regarding the basement's condition after a storm, and LiHua responds to the check-in."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith provides LiHua with the necessary measurements for making curtains, showing coordination and cooperation."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua helps AdamSmith by providing the measurements, contributing to his curtain-making process."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua seeks advice from AdamSmith about hanging her new artwork, and AdamSmith provides instructions and expresses enthusiasm for the outcome."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith communicates with LiHua to book a curtain and updates her about its status."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith initiates the conversation and offers assistance, while LiHua responds positively and suggests a time for installation."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith provides assistance and support to LiHua regarding the curtains and basement usage."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua sends a fruit basket to AdamSmith as a token of appreciation for his support as a landlord."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua asks AdamSmith for permission to get a small fridge for the basement."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith initiates the conversation and invites LiHua to the electronics store for a shopping trip."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith informs Li Hua about the fridge delivery, ensuring Li Hua is prepared."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua asks AdamSmith for permission to add potted plants to the basement, which AdamSmith agrees to."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith offers LiHua a space to practice musical instruments, and LiHua expresses interest and plans to visit."|&gt;"offer acceptance, practice space"&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith offers LiHua a space to practice musical instruments, and LiHua plans to visit."|&gt;"offer, acceptance, practice space"&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith reminds LiHua to pick up the key for the basement at 9am."|&gt;"reminder, schedule"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua seeks permission from AdamSmith to add sound-insulating pads to the basement, and AdamSmith agrees to the plan and offers assistance."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith reminds Li Hua to keep the noise down, and Li Hua agrees and promises to do so."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua initiates the meeting and invites AdamSmith to discuss the basement renovation progress."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith reminds LiHua about the rent and provides assistance, while LiHua expresses gratitude and reciprocates the help."|&gt;"rent reminders, mutual assistance"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua informs AdamSmith about her rent payment and seeks his help with local recommendations."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith informs Li Hua about potential pipe issues and requests her attention to it."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith invites Li Hua to a neighborhood potluck dinner and offers help if needed."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith reminds LiHua about the community garden cleanup event, and LiHua expresses willingness to participate despite initial uncertainty."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith informs LiHua about a power outage and offers assistance, while LiHua confirms readiness and thanks AdamSmith."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith reminds LiHua about the power outage and offers assistance."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith communicates with Li Hua about the air-conditioner installation and schedules the installation time based on her availability."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith communicates with Li Hua, asking for help in managing noise levels from neighbors."&lt;SEP&gt;"AdamSmith communicates with Li Hua, requesting her to manage noise levels from neighbors."</data>
