    <edge source="&quot;LIHUA&quot;" target="&quot;YURIKOYAMAMOTO&quot;">
      <data key="d3">494.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Both YurikoYamamoto and LiHua communicated about meeting at Central Perk café to discuss YurikoYamamoto's studio's homepage."|&gt;"meeting, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and YurikoYamamoto are both participants in the jam session planning and execution, showing mutual enthusiasm and support."|&gt;"mutual support, enthusiasm"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and YurikoYamamoto both contribute to the Music Jam Sessions, bringing their instruments and enthusiasm, showing collaboration and involvement."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and YurikoYamamoto both participate in the musical jams and express enthusiasm."|&gt;"participant, shared excitement"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua invites Yuriko to join music jam sessions with Wolfgang, showing an invitation and interest in her participation."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua offers suggestions for promoting the new feature, and YurikoYamamoto appreciates the advice and prepares posts and a newsletter."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua offers to share the demo website with YurikoYamamoto, fostering a collaborative relationship and excitement about the upcoming meeting."|&gt;"excitement, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto invites LiHua to the meeting to discuss the demo website, highlighting the importance of their partnership."|&gt;"invitation, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto suggests adding community outreach programs to the demo website, and LiHua responds positively and offers to help brainstorm ideas."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua offers suggestions and participates actively, while YurikoYamamoto discusses musical styles and improvisation."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua encourages YurikoYamamoto to share her music preferences and collaborate on jam sessions, fostering a creative and inclusive atmosphere."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua encourages YurikoYamamoto to share her music preferences and collaborate on jam sessions, fostering a creative and inclusive atmosphere."|&gt;"jamming, creative collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua expresses enthusiasm for an official band, and YurikoYamamoto suggests picking a theme."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto seeks advice from LiHua on adding a 'leave a message' feature to the studio website."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and YurikoYamamoto brainstorm about mixing styles in their performances, showcasing their collaborative spirit and desire for variety in their music."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto suggests songs, and LiHua agrees with her suggestions."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto mentions filling the basement with energy, encouraging everyone to bring their enthusiasm and enjoy the practice session."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto reminds everyone to come in with enthusiasm and mentions bringing snacks for fuel."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto encourages LiHua to prepare her guitar, while LiHua looks forward to the practice session."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto suggests LiHua's guitar skills will add to the vibe, while LiHua looks forward to the collaboration and sharing ideas."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua, YurikoYamamoto, and ChaeSong-hwa express enthusiasm about jamming and creating music together."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua supports the idea, while YurikoYamamoto is enthusiastic about letting creativity flow and making something amazing."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto and LiHua discuss her work and future events, indicating their close professional relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto and LiHua discuss her work and future events."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto imagines the resulting music and LiHua looks forward to the jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto and LiHua discuss progress with the child and plan a jam session, showing a supportive and collaborative relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto and LiHua discuss progress with the child and plan a jam session, showing a supportive and collaborative relationship."|&gt;|"supportive collaboration, jam session planning"&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto suggests researching traditional Chinese melodies, aligning with LiHua's enthusiasm for exploring cultural elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto suggests "Chasing Cars" and LiHua agrees to record the session."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto and LiHua discuss the language development of babies, sharing insights and experiences."|"conversation, professional exchange"&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto initiates the request for help from LiHua by meeting at the freelancer gathering and discussing the homepage improvement."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua offers to improve the Studio's Homepage within two weeks, and Yuriko Yamamoto expresses appreciation and excitement."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua confirms the meeting time for YurikoYamamoto, and YurikoYamamoto expresses enthusiasm about the meeting and the brainstorming session."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua introduces Yuriko and plans a jam session, showing their mutual interest in music and social gatherings."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua invites Yuriko to the final website presentation and provides details about the meeting location."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua invites Yuriko to view the final website and discusses a meeting time."|"meeting invitation, discussion"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua reminds Yuriko about the meeting at Central Perk, and Yuriko confirms her attendance and expresses excitement."|&gt;"reminder, confirmation"&lt;SEP&gt;"Yuriko Yamamoto reminds Li Hua about the chat and brainstorming session at Central Perk, expressing enthusiasm for their discussion."|&gt;"reminder, discussion"</data>
      <data key="d5">"collaboration, involvement"&lt;SEP&gt;"collaborative effort, musical exchange"&lt;SEP&gt;"collaborative spirit, style mixing"&lt;SEP&gt;"communication, collaborative song selection"&lt;SEP&gt;"cultural exploration, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"encouragement, preparation"&lt;SEP&gt;"energy encouragement, practice session atmosphere"&lt;SEP&gt;"enthusiasm, musical collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"imagination, anticipation"&lt;SEP&gt;"invitation, interest"&lt;SEP&gt;"jamming, creative collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"meeting confirmation, shared excitement"&lt;SEP&gt;"professional collaboration, discussion"&lt;SEP&gt;"reminder, snack suggestion"&lt;SEP&gt;"request for assistance"&lt;SEP&gt;"seeking advice, providing assistance"&lt;SEP&gt;"song suggestions, agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"suggestion, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"suggestion, shared enthusiasm"&lt;SEP&gt;"suggestions, appreciation"&lt;SEP&gt;"support, creative expression"&lt;SEP&gt;"supportive collaboration, jam session planning"&lt;SEP&gt;"task assignment, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"team suggestion, discussion"&lt;SEP&gt;6&lt;SEP&gt;7&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;9&lt;SEP&gt;"introduction, mutual interest"&lt;SEP&gt;"invitation, planning"&lt;SEP&gt;7&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-0c2be2cf51dc59e0fc9e1ae7a0d0c368&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cf551afcff3cea776522a553ed08dec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213f3accc70887139b20d62a8c95d54b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21a62c8919d04ba7ddb851be8988bf61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21de16fffd4dc0af32991bb42d761be5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-261da2e0337a92d1f7a8f0e4690d68db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32afdd1b003fbdbf675b07a86c66ac15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32f7a8908a42bb38c411b72bdc0204b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34ff95eb10ec23c105813ac7d8360f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38cf925beddfe6480a0d498c5503ba58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-410b6bd3e72cc26c6ed3e43e4985c177&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65774e8846a7a9ff2e40f24fd1085ade&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65dbb0ed245f2ba4577e368bc71f9527&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ca9fc6bc04569c8ecb550e6791adaa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-734e27a060a5d1b368cb27be205679c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-768a9e27adbb0345edec54584a5662c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a07436d4991d1b9d4340f981156c8f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-837a68c660c314328034401f1ea8b568&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ad87bb5dedc5ee9a0daaf6f38056412&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a361f8bd753b8727cf1f91a9f78e3bec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a49466a5eb6486cb7fdf68382c442f81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b09f7eed0de7ff994fb84151074090a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6bd518bddc4a404366febca950f73c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b809786e62c2394043a661b475309d92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c87b25672e5e1b744b54cc6dffd92b4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db78e24226822ad20b9a08c03efffd2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e92f03813e03e2fa384824e155beb6af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea255d16ab80f05102d8be94e8583962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3281427475f6d47792b7a67f82bebb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f349d26bb02a383be8653143bb611996&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7b188c818e161da72bec5bd26c06040</data>
