    <edge source="&quot;LIHUA&quot;" target="&quot;HAILEYJOHNSON&quot;">
      <data key="d3">293.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"HaileyJohnson checks in with Li Hua about her recent experience with rosemary focaccia and offers future baked goods."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson leaves bread and milk for LiHua, who responds positively and inquires about the bakery's process."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson offers her doorstep delivery service to LiHua, and LiHua expresses interest in trying it out."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua makes a request for bread delivery from HaileyJohnson, and HaileyJohnson agrees to provide it twice a week."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson reminds LiHua about the delivery of fresh bread and suggests trying the rosemary focaccia."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson reminds Li Hua about the bread delivery, indicating a friendly interaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson informs LiHua about the new gluten-free bread options and LiHua's eagerness to try them."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson invites LiHua to the Bakery's anniversary event, showing a friendly invitation."|&gt;"invitation, social gathering"&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson invites LiHua to the bakery anniversary event, showing a friendly invitation."|&gt;"invitation, social gathering"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua appreciated HaileyJohnson's baking and delivery services, expressing gratitude and looking forward to future interactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson initiates a conversation with LiHua about the anniversary event and new products, leading to feedback and suggestions."|&gt;"conversation, feedback exchange"&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson informs LiHua about the summer promotion and offers to make something special for her."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson invites Li Hua to attend her free baking class at the bakery."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson invites Li Hua to attend the free baking class she is hosting."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson organizes the baking class and LiHua expresses interest and willingness to attend and learn pastry making."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson invites LiHua to the event at the bakery, showing a friendly and proactive approach to sharing news."|&gt;"invitation, friendly communication"&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson initiates a check-in and seeks feedback from LiHua regarding the bread delivery, and LiHua responds with feedback."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson seeks feedback from LiHua on pastries, while LiHua provides positive feedback and suggestions."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson requests LiHua's help in gathering feedback from customers for the bread-tasting event at the bakery."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson requests LiHua's help in organizing a bread-tasting event at the bakery."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson offers a discount to LiHua, who expresses interest in the sale and requests specific items."|&gt;"customer-service, discount offer"&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson offers a discount to LiHua, who expresses interest in the sale."|&gt;"discount offer, customer service"&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson invites LiHua to the Bakery to taste the new bread recipe she's made."</data>
      <data key="d5">"appreciation, positive feedback"&lt;SEP&gt;"assistance request, event coordination"&lt;SEP&gt;"assistance request, event organization"&lt;SEP&gt;"class organizer, participant"&lt;SEP&gt;"customer interaction, product announcement"&lt;SEP&gt;"feedback exchange, collaborative innovation"&lt;SEP&gt;"feedback exchange, communication"&lt;SEP&gt;"gift-giving, exchange of goods"&lt;SEP&gt;"invitation, culinary collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"invitation, social engagement"&lt;SEP&gt;"offer, interest"&lt;SEP&gt;"positive feedback, offering baked goods"&lt;SEP&gt;"promotion announcement, personalized offer"&lt;SEP&gt;"reminder, delivery"&lt;SEP&gt;"reminder, suggestion"&lt;SEP&gt;"request-response, service provision"&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
