    <edge source="&quot;LIHUA&quot;" target="&quot;CHAESONG-HWA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">495.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Both team members suggest healthy eating habits and share recipes, contributing to the overall healthy eating challenge."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa and LiHua discuss plans for karaoke, showing a mutual interest and collaboration."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa invites LiHua to attend the medical knowledge lecture, and LiHua accepts the invitation and looks forward to participating."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa invites LiHua to join the bonfire singing party."|&gt;"invitation, participation"&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa invites LiHua to join the medical knowledge lecture, and LiHua expresses interest and enthusiasm."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa reminds LiHua about the lecture and engages in conversation about the topic and preparations for the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa reminds LiHua about the lecture and engages in conversation about the topic and preparations for the event."|&gt;"reminder, conversation"&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa organizes a karaoke activity and invites LiHua to join, while LiHua responds positively and expresses interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa organizes a karaoke activity and invites LiHua to join, while LiHua responds positively and expresses interest."|&gt;"invitation, acceptance"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua encourages ChaeSong-hwa to share personal interests and engage in discussions, fostering a collaborative environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua encourages ChaeSong-hwa to share personal interests and engage in discussions, fostering a collaborative environment."|&gt;"collaboration, discussion"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and ChaeSong-hwa both propose ideas, contributing to the team's creative energy."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa reminds LiHua to take care of their voices and stay hydrated, emphasizing the importance of good vocal health for the jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua suggests revisiting 'The History of Everything' from Big Bang Theory, which ChaeSong-hwa enthusiastically agrees to perform."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa suggests songs, and LiHua agrees with his suggestions."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and ChaeSong-hwa are both participants in the jam session planning and execution, expressing excitement and anticipation."|&gt;"excitement, anticipation"&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa shares enthusiasm, and LiHua conveys excitement and positivity about the garden project."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa and LiHua both express enthusiasm for the practice session, showing a shared interest in the upcoming collaboration."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa looks forward to LiHua's guitar skills, while LiHua looks forward to the collaboration and sharing ideas."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa provides sleep-related advice and invites LiHua to plan a chill night, emphasizing the importance of self-care and relaxation."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa provides sleep-related advice and invites LiHua to plan a chill night, emphasizing the importance of self-care and relaxation."|&gt;"caring, invitation"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua accepts ChaeSong-hwa's invitation to plan a chill night, indicating a willingness to engage in self-care activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua accepts ChaeSong-hwa's invitation to plan a chill night, indicating a willingness to engage in self-care activities."|&gt;"acceptance, self-care"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua expresses admiration and excitement for ChaeSong-hwa's performance, and they both look forward to their next jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua expresses admiration and excitement for ChaeSong-hwa's performance, and they both look forward to their next rehearsal and jam session."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa seeks advice from LiHua on balancing work and personal hobbies."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa seeks advice from LiHua on balancing work and personal hobbies."|&gt;"advice-seeking, peer support"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua supports the idea, while ChaeSong-hwa proposes exploring themes that resonate with the group and connecting with personal stories."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa suggests sticking to Sundays and LiHua confirms the usual jam day."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa initiates the conversation and proposes the idea of a music playlist for babies, while LiHua responds positively and shares her thoughts on what songs to include."|&gt;"conversation, suggestion exchange"&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa initiates the conversation and proposes the idea of a music playlist for babies, while LiHua responds positively and suggests songs."|&gt;"conversation, suggestion exchange"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua looks forward to the jam session and ChaeSong-hwa expresses excitement for the project."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua looks forward to the event and the community project, which ChaeSong-hwa agrees to support and contribute to the planning process."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa engages in brainstorming with LiHua about incorporating Chinese elements, suggesting a collaborative approach."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa discusses avocados and their health benefits, while LiHua shares her preferences and offers recipes."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa provides recipes and creative ideas for using avocados, while LiHua offers her own favorite dishes and suggestions for variations."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa suggests adding cool rhythms and LiHua confirms recording the session."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa sends a Christmas gift to LiHua, and both express excitement and anticipation for future plans."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and ChaeSong-hwa both agree on the importance of leashes for safety and control."|&gt;"agreement, shared views"&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and ChaeSong-hwa exchange greetings and discuss their current situations, indicating a friendly and social relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and ChaeSong-hwa exchange greetings and plans to meet up again, indicating a friendly and social relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa and Li Hua discuss and plan their jam session, showing coordination and enthusiasm for collaboration."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa provides a health tip about taking a warm shower before sleeping, which Li Hua finds useful and agrees to try."|&gt;"health tip sharing, positive response"&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa and Li Hua plan to discuss the topic further during a jam session, suggesting a collaborative effort."|&gt;"collaborative effort, music and science"&lt;SEP&gt;"Li Hua discusses the refreshing experience of making music, while Chae Song-hwa brings energy and enthusiasm to the group."|&gt;"motivation sharing, energy"</data>
