 rules."&lt;SEP&gt;"Li Hua looks forward to practicing together and getting out there to play after understanding the rules."|&gt;"practice, excitement"&lt;SEP&gt;"JakeWatson provides advice to Li Hua on how to avoid being offside in football, and Li Hua plans to practice with Jake Watson on the field."</data>
