      <data key="d3">235.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"WolfgangSchulz and YurikoYamamoto both participate in the musical jams and suggest future jams."|&gt;"participant, future jam suggestions"&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz seeks feedback from YurikoYamamoto about his sound preferences, and she offers suggestions and asks about his plans."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz expresses enthusiasm for the jam session, while YurikoYamamoto contributes ideas and discusses musical styles."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz shares his musical interests with YurikoYamamoto, initiating a dialogue and potential collaboration."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz shares his musical interests with YurikoYamamoto, initiating a dialogue and potential collaboration."|&gt;"musical interest, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz suggests keeping the vibe fun, and YurikoYamamoto expresses enthusiasm for an official band."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz initiates the brainstorming session, and YurikoYamamoto responds with her ideas."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto encourages everyone to bring their energy, and WolfgangSchulz agrees."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto coordinates the practice session, and WolfgangSchulz participates and suggests running through the parts together."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto encourages everyone to enjoy every moment and have fun while playing."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto and WolfgangSchulz are both participants in the jam session planning and execution, contributing ideas and enthusiasm."|&gt;"idea sharing, enthusiasm"&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto suggests Sunday as the day for practice, while WolfgangSchulz prioritizes his work schedule."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto suggests sticking to the usual Sunday jam sessions, while WolfgangSchulz agrees and emphasizes having fun and enjoying the process."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz and YurikoYamamoto both suggest incorporating heavier tracks into their setlist."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz suggests incorporating original songs, while YurikoYamamoto is enthusiastic about letting creativity flow and making something amazing."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz discusses jazz-rock fusion ideas with YurikoYamamoto, who offers her thoughts on the concept."&lt;SEP&gt;"WolfgangSchulz informs YurikoYamamoto about his absence due to a business trip, and YurikoYamamoto responds with support and encouragement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yuriko Yamamoto shares insights about the cognitive benefits of playing musical instruments, while Wolfgang Schulz discusses the relaxing and therapeutic aspects of playing music."|&gt;"insight sharing, relaxation"&lt;SEP&gt;"Yuriko and Wolfgang plan a jam session, indicating their mutual enthusiasm for music and social activities."</data>
      <data key="d5">"brainstorming, creative input"&lt;SEP&gt;"collaborative effort, musical discussion"&lt;SEP&gt;"communication, support"&lt;SEP&gt;"coordination, participation"&lt;SEP&gt;"encouragement, agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"encouragement, enjoyment"&lt;SEP&gt;"enthusiasm, creative expression"&lt;SEP&gt;"idea exchange, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"jam session planning, atmosphere maintenance"&lt;SEP&gt;"musical interest, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"sound preferences, suggestions"&lt;SEP&gt;"suggestion, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"suggestion, conflicting priorities"&lt;SEP&gt;"team suggestion, enthusiasm"&lt;SEP&gt;6&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;"mutual interest, social engagement"&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
