    <edge source="&quot;YURIKOYAMAMOTO&quot;" target="&quot;CHAESONG-HWA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">236.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Both ChaeSong-hwa and YurikoYamamoto express excitement about the upcoming practice session, suggesting a positive and collaborative atmosphere."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa shares his musical interests with YurikoYamamoto, initiating a dialogue and potential collaboration."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa shares his musical interests with YurikoYamamoto, initiating a dialogue and potential collaboration."|&gt;"musical interest, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa supports mixing genres, and YurikoYamamoto suggests a theme."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto suggests a theme, and ChaeSong-hwa supports mixing genres."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto and ChaeSong-hwa both contribute ideas, showcasing diverse approaches to band naming."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto suggests songs, and ChaeSong-hwa agrees with her suggestions."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto encourages everyone to bring their A-game, while ChaeSong-hwa practices the song and emphasizes keeping it relaxed."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto mentions creating beautiful music together, aligning with ChaeSong-hwa's intention to make the practice session special."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto and ChaeSong-hwa are both participants in the jam session planning and execution, expressing excitement and anticipation."|&gt;"excitement, anticipation"&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto and ChaeSong-hwa both express enthusiasm for the song and the upcoming performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto suggests ChaeSong-hwa's voice will shine in the performance, while ChaeSong-hwa looks forward to the collaboration and sharing ideas."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa suggests performing 'Bohemian Rhapsody' and expresses excitement, while YurikoYamamoto agrees and is enthusiastic about the idea."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto and ChaeSong-hwa mention the importance of staying flexible due to the ongoing Garden Renovation Project."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa proposes exploring themes that resonate with the group and connecting with personal stories, while YurikoYamamoto is enthusiastic about letting creativity flow and making something amazing."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa suggests 'A Million Dreams' and YurikoYamamoto expresses enthusiasm about the song."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa suggests jazz-rock fusion, and YurikoYamamoto offers her thoughts on the concept."&lt;SEP&gt;"ChaeSong-hwa supports YurikoYamamoto's idea of using traditional Chinese instruments, indicating alignment in creative direction."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto suggests "Tears in Heaven" and ChaeSong-hwa agrees to try it out."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yuriko Yamamoto and Chae Song-hwa discuss the music festival and its potential post-festival activities."</data>
      <data key="d5">"collaborative effort, diverse input"&lt;SEP&gt;"communication, collaborative song selection"&lt;SEP&gt;"creative alignment, support"&lt;SEP&gt;"encouragement, practice emphasis"&lt;SEP&gt;"flexibility, adaptation"&lt;SEP&gt;"inspiration, creative expression"&lt;SEP&gt;"music creation, practice session atmosphere"&lt;SEP&gt;"musical interest, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"positive atmosphere, excitement"&lt;SEP&gt;"song suggestions, agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"suggestion, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"suggestion, positive reaction"&lt;SEP&gt;"suggestion, shared enthusiasm"&lt;SEP&gt;"team suggestion, discussion"&lt;SEP&gt;"teamwork, enthusiasm exchange"&lt;SEP&gt;"teamwork, shared passion"&lt;SEP&gt;6&lt;SEP&gt;7&lt;SEP&gt;"discussion, shared interests"</data>
